        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>扶梯与间隔发车 Page-4</title>\n<script src=\"https://polyfill.io/v3/polyfill.min.js?features=es6\"></script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n    body {\n        font-family: \"Kaiti\", \"STKaiti\", \"KaiTi_GB2312\", serif;\n        line-height: 1.8;\n        color: #222;\n        background-color: #fff;\n        padding: 30px;\n        max-width: 900px;\n        margin: 0 auto;\n        font-size: 18px;\n    }\n    .header {\n        font-size: 1.1em;\n        margin-bottom: 20px;\n        margin-left: 20px;\n    }\n    .red-text {\n        color: #d32f2f;\n    }\n    .star {\n        color: #d32f2f;\n        margin-right: 5px;\n        font-size: 1.2em;\n    }\n    .section {\n        margin-bottom: 40px;\n    }\n    .point {\n        display: flex;\n        align-items: flex-start;\n        margin-bottom: 15px;\n    }\n    .point .star {\n        flex-shrink: 0;\n        margin-top: -2px;\n    }\n    .example {\n        display: flex;\n        margin-left: 30px;\n        margin-bottom: 15px;\n    }\n    .example .label {\n        flex-shrink: 0;\n        margin-right: 5px;\n    }\n    .analysis {\n        margin-left: 60px;\n        margin-bottom: 15px;\n    }\n    .analysis-label {\n        margin-bottom: 5px;\n    }\n    .sub-point {\n        margin-left: 30px;\n        margin-bottom: 15px;\n    }\n    .annotation {\n        font-size: 0.85em;\n        color: #333;\n        margin-left: 220px;\n        margin-top: -5px;\n        margin-bottom: 5px;\n    }\n    .right-eq {\n        margin-left: 380px;\n        line-height: 1.5;\n    }\n    .solution {\n        margin-left: 30px;\n    }\n    .solution .line {\n        margin-bottom: 8px;\n    }\n    .equations {\n        margin-left: 120px;\n        margin-bottom: 15px;\n        line-height: 1.6;\n    }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"header\">&lt;&lt;扶梯与间隔发车&gt;&gt; Page-4</div>\n\n<div class=\"section\">\n    <div class=\"point\">\n        <span class=\"star\">★</span>\n        <span class=\"red-text\">列方程解题时，以“车间距始终固定不变”为依据来建立等量关系。</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"example\">\n        <span class=\"label\">例：</span>\n        <span class=\"content\">A步行速度为60米/分，A发现每隔15分钟就会有一辆1路公交车追上他，而每隔10分钟就与一辆迎面开来的1路公交车相遇。求1路公交车间隔发车的时间。</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"analysis\">\n        <div class=\"analysis-label\">分析：</div>\n        <div class=\"sub-point\">\n            <span class=\"red-text\">① 无论是后面开来的，还是迎面开来的，都是1路公交车，即：车间距始终相等。</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"sub-point\">\n            <span class=\"red-text\">② “从后面追来的”：人车同向：\\(S_{差} = 车间距 = V_{差} \\cdot t_{追及间隔}\\)</span>\n            <div class=\"annotation\">等量关系 \\(\\leftarrow\\) 相等</div>\n            <div class=\"right-eq\">\n                \\(= (V_{车} - 60) \\times 15\\)<br>\n                \\(= 15(V_{车} - 60)\\)\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"sub-point\">\n            <span class=\"red-text\">③ 迎面相遇的：人车相向：\\(S_{和} = 车间距 = V_{和} \\cdot t_{相遇间隔}\\)</span>\n            <div class=\"right-eq\">\n                \\(= (V_{车} + 60) \\times 10\\)<br>\n                \\(= 10(V_{车} + 60)\\)\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"solution\">\n        <div class=\"line\">解：设1路公交车的速度为 \\(x\\) 米/分，根据题意，得：</div>\n        <div class=\"equations\">\n            <div>\\(15(x - 60) = 10(x + 60)\\)</div>\n            <div>\\(15x - 900 = 10x + 600\\)</div>\n            <div>\\(15x - 10x = 600 + 900\\)</div>\n            <div>\\(5x = 1500\\)</div>\n            <div>\\(x = 300\\)</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"line\">即：1路公交车的速度为300米/分。</div>\n        <div class=\"line\">车间距：\\(15 \\times (300 - 60) = 3600\\) (米) 或 \\(10 \\times (300 + 60) = 3600\\) (米)</div>\n        <div class=\"line\">根据“车间距 = \\(V_{车} \\cdot t_{发车间隔}\\)”可得：</div>\n        <div class=\"line\">\\(t_{发车间隔} = 车间距 \\div V_{车} = 3600 \\div 300 = 12\\) (分)</div>\n        <div class=\"line\">答：1路公交车的发车时间间隔为12分钟。</div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"section\">\n    <div class=\"point\">\n        <span class=\"star\">★</span>\n        <span class=\"red-text\">若题中只给时间、速度的倍数，可设较小的速度为 \\(a\\)，再根据倍数关系表示其他量来解题。（不建议设较小的速度为“1”：设 \\(a\\) 更有说服力；最后 \\(a\\) 被抵消时，才能更直观的看出与“\\(a\\)”无关）</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"example\">\n        <span class=\"label\">例：</span>\n        <span class=\"content\">A在马路上骑车时，发现每隔9分钟都会有一辆公交车追上他；A换出租车后又发现，每隔9分钟出租车就能超过一辆公交车。已知出租车的速度为骑车速度的5倍。若公交车的发车时间间隔相同，求此发车间隔的时间。</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"analysis\">\n        <div style=\"display: flex; align-items: flex-start;\">\n            <span class=\"analysis-label\" style=\"margin-right: 5px;\">分析：</span>\n            <span class=\"red-text\">① 公交车&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;骑车的A：二者同向 \\(\\rightarrow\\) 路程差为车间距。</span>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
